Adventurer,

*Wild Blood* ( https://albiononline.com/update/wild-blood ) is nearby, and =
you=E2=80=99ll be able to hunt some down for yourself when the update launc=
hes. In this Dev Talk, Game Director Robin Henkys looks at *Tracking* , a n=
ew feature where you pursue creatures across the open world.

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DchbbRlKZ_fg )

Or click *here* ( https://albiononline.com/news/dev-talk-tracking-potions )=
 for a written summary.

Refer a Friend and Claim the Snow Leopard
-----------------------------------------

A new *Referral Season* ( https://albiononline.com/news/referral-october-20=
23 ) has arrived, and there=E2=80=99s another chance to get the *Snow Leopa=
rd* when you refer just one friend!

The Snow Leopard is an elegant, hibernal skin for your *Swiftclaw* base mou=
nt, with snowy gray fur and piercing blue eyes. Once unlocked, it can be us=
ed by any of your characters on that particular server (either Albion East =
or West).

( https://albiononline.com/news/referral-october-2023 )

There are also big rewards for your *third* and *fifth referrals* : a *T7 P=
ile of Tomes worth 100,000 Fame* for your third referral, and a *T8 Pile of=
 Tomes worth 200,000 Fame* for your fifth. And for your first ever referral=
, you=E2=80=99ll get a T8 Pile of Tomes in addition to the Snow Leopard!

This Referral Season lasts until *23:59:59 UTC on October 31* , so invite y=
our friends and enjoy these rewards!

The Harvest Challenge is Back!
------------------------------

Fall has come to the world of Albion... the shadows are growing longer... a=
nd the *Harvest Challenge* ( https://albiononline.com/news/harvest-challeng=
e-2023 ) is back! For the entire month of October, earn points for open-wor=
ld activities, unlock chests to get spooky loot, and claim your very own Sp=
ectral Bat.

( https://albiononline.com/news/harvest-challenge-2023 )

As always, you can earn Challenge Points by *gathering, fishing, farming,* =
and *killing monsters*. Points count simultaneously toward a daily bonus, a=
 weekly unlockable chest, and the monthly mount and avatar ring reward. So =
log in, head out into the open world, gather points, and claim these reward=
s while they last!

